<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_acknowledgements"><a href="#Sx1.acknowledgements1" title="In Declarations ‣ Building High-Quality Datasets for Portuguese LLMs: From Common Crawl Snapshots to Industrial-Grade Corpora" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Acknowledgements</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Building High-Quality Datasets for Portuguese LLMs: From Common Crawl Snapshots to Industrial-Grade Corpora" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A1" title="In Building High-Quality Datasets for Portuguese LLMs: From Common Crawl Snapshots to Industrial-Grade Corpora" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A </span>Rules Used for Document Selection</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Building High-Quality Datasets for Portuguese LLMs: From Common Crawl Snapshots to Industrial-Grade Corpora" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Full Results per Poeta Task</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Building High-Quality Datasets for Portuguese LLMs: From Common Crawl Snapshots to Industrial-Grade Corpora" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Prompts for Classifier Training</span></a></li>
